---
// sync-coffee/about.astro
// About page for Synchronize Coffee

import SyncCoffeeLayout from "../../layouts/SyncCoffeeLayout.astro";
---

<SyncCoffeeLayout 
  title="About - Synchronize Coffee"
  description="The story of Synchronize Coffee — a community third space rooted in art, connection, and exceptional coffee."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-stone-50 dark:from-emerald-950 to-white dark:to-gray-950 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300 mb-6">Our Story</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Community. Art. Connection. Coffee.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Story -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Synchronize Coffee began with a simple question: <em>What if a coffee shop was more than just a place to grab a drink?</em>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        We opened Synchronize in 2019 as a response to a neighborhood that felt fragmented. We saw artists with nowhere to display work. Musicians with no platform. Cyclists looking for community. Remote workers needing a desk and a sense of belonging.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        So we created a third space — not home, not work, but a place to synchronize. To find your rhythm. To connect with people doing interesting things.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-12">
        Today, Synchronize is a gathering place where exceptional coffee fuels conversation, art adorns the walls, musicians perform, and community members find their place.
      </p>

      <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-emerald-800 pt-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-10">Our Values</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300 mb-4">Quality First</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              We source single-origin beans directly from growers we know and trust. Every cup reflects our commitment to excellence and transparency.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300 mb-4">Community Centered</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              We're here for people. Artists, cyclists, remote workers, students, families. We listen, we adapt, we make space for what matters to you.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300 mb-4">Sustainability</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              We partner with farmers practicing sustainable agriculture. We minimize waste, support local suppliers, and care for the land that feeds us.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300 mb-4">Creativity & Connection</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              Art, music, collaboration — we believe creativity thrives when people gather with intention. We make space for all of it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Warm divider -->
  <div class="relative h-48 md:h-64 overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/light_colored_wood.webp" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30 dark:opacity-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white dark:from-gray-950 via-transparent to-white dark:to-gray-950"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Team Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-emerald-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-12 text-center">Meet the Team</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <img src="/casey-kim.webp" alt="Alex — Owner & Coffee Roaster" class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto mb-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Alex</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">Owner & Coffee Roaster</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Built Synchronize to be a gathering place. Coffee obsessive. Bicycle commuter.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <img src="/leila-navarro.webp" alt="Jordan — Curator & Community Liaison" class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto mb-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Jordan</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">Curator & Community Liaison</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Connects artists to our space. Organizes events. Makes sure we're listening to the community.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <img src="/noah-bennett-example.webp" alt="Sam — Baker & Kitchen Lead" class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto mb-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Sam</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">Baker & Kitchen Lead</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Bakes everything fresh. Sources local ingredients. Loves feeding people well.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-emerald-900 dark:bg-emerald-950 text-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">Join Us</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-stone-100 mb-8">
        Come experience Synchronize. Whether you're here for the coffee, the community, or just a quiet space to think — we're glad you stopped by.
      </p>
      <a href="/sync-coffee/contact/" class="inline-block bg-white text-emerald-900 px-8 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-stone-50 transition rounded-lg">
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SyncCoffeeLayout>
